  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-NIS-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Have you recovered the Seed of Death from Kagemoosha? I suspect not. Return when you've got it with you.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Dworgyn_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfDworgyn_QST_37.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 82209,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-NIS-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now that we've a dram of the Quintessence of Fear, the next necessary component is a Seed of Death. \"What's it for?\" you ask? Patience, young Wizard. All will be revealed at the proper time. To tell you now would be premature. \\n",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Dworgyn_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfDworgyn_QST_38.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 82209,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-NIS-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "To gain a Seed of Death, you've got to go and fight the powerful demon creature known as Kagemoosha, in MooShu. Kagemoosha carries a seed that is the source of his strength, a seed from which can only sprout death, not life. \\n",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Dworgyn_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfDworgyn_QST_39.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 82209,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-NIS-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Journey now to MooShu and fight Kagemoosha, and return at once with the Seed of Death.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Dworgyn_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfDworgyn_QST_40.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 82209,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-NIS-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You seem pleased with yourself! Have you got a nice little Seed of Death to show me? Seed and water... just one more step and that spell is yours!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Dworgyn_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfDworgyn_QST_41.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 82209,
